   "answer": "Task-CoEvolve reduces total search time by about half for both models: from 22.2 to 11.5 hours for GPT-5.6 Luna and from 38.0 to 20.5 hours for Qwen3.6. The two fixed costs limiting further time reduction are: (1) trials executed with 10-way parallelism, making search time depend on longest-running tasks rather than number of evaluated tasks, and (2) candidate proposal by the meta-agent taking about 2.4–3.3 hours regardless of evaluation budget. [3:25]"
