   "answer": "WikiSkill's knowledge and tracking layers consist of the Wiki Layer (wiki/) and the Skills Layer (skills/). The Wiki Layer contains pattern directory (patterns/), evolution log (logs.md) updated by the Wiki Maintainer, and skill impact tracker (skill-impact.md) updated programmatically by the outer-loop harness after validation gating. The Skills Layer contains active procedural skills with each skill directory having SKILL.md (full skill content) and PURPOSE.md (maps skill to motivating Wiki patterns). The Wiki Maintainer updates the wiki, and the Skill Proposer proposes skill updates. [5:11][5:12]"
